# Build context of the TOM image (TOM-232): the Dockerfile only copies the add-on submodules and
# additional-requirements.txt. Keep repository metadata, docs, tests, deployment files and local
# secrets out of the context (and out of the image, for the whole-submodule COPYs).
.git
**/.git
.github/
.idea/
.claude/
.features/
tests/
deployment/
nginx-conf/
nginx-conf-new/
docker-compose.yaml
odoo.conf
*.sh
**/.env
**/.env.*
